=== any with generator expression
xs.stream().anyMatch(x -> x > 0)

=== all with generator expression
xs.stream().allMatch(x -> x > 0)

=== any with generator expression and condition
xs.stream().filter(x -> x % 2 == 0).anyMatch(x -> x > 0)

=== any with equality comparison
xs.stream().anyMatch(x -> x == target)

=== any assigns to variable
boolean found = xs.stream().anyMatch(x -> x > 0);

=== any with dict items tuple unpack
d.entrySet().stream().anyMatch(e -> e.getValue() > 10)
